#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:7
#: 6ea99445ff3f4ac78f0b59ff946770b9 7dfd0ba5c71a433ca019083acb166f77
#: 860719a613fe4d2d883134fcf9ef34f7 a0c1ddde6df4474294da32a34a4b2477
#: c4852e03e42d4c1ab9770c924f84ff0b
msgid ""
"The `Lowrance Elite Ti2 sonar "
"<https://www.lowrance.com/lowrance/type/fishfinders-"
"chartplotters/elite-7-ti2-us-inland-ai-3-in-1/>`__ can be connected to the "
"autopilot so that the sonar can use the autopilot's position estimate (which"
" is normally better than the sonar's built-in GPS) and the autopilot can "
"record and report the sonar's simple depth."
msgstr ""
"`Lowrance Elite Ti2 声呐 <https://www.lowrance.com/lowrance/type/fishfinders-"
"chartplotters/elite-7-ti2-us-inland-ai-3-in-1/>`__ "
"可连接到飞控，使声呐能够使用飞控的位置估计（通常比声呐内置 GPS 更准确），同时飞控可以记录和报告声呐的简单深度数据。"

